+# Task Completion
+- Run the directly affected test file(s), preferably with `node --test test/<file>.test.js` for fast feedback.
+- Run `npm run lint` for source/style changes.
+- Run `npm run test:types` when declarations or exposed API typing changes.
+- Run `npm run unit` for lifecycle/core changes when practical; `npm test` is the full lint + unit + type gate.
+- Do not edit generated `lib/config-validator.js` or `lib/error-serializer.js` manually; use `npm run test:validator:integrity` only when validation configuration generation is affected.
\ No newline at end of file
