+# Tech Stack
+- Node.js web framework, CommonJS JavaScript runtime (`package.json` has `type: commonjs`).
+- TypeScript declarations and type tests; TypeScript pinned to `~6.0.2`.
+- npm scripts/package workflow; lockfile should not be changed for ordinary code fixes.
+- Unit runner: `borp`, tests generally use built-in `node:test`.
+- Lint: ESLint 9 with `neostandard`; type checks: `tstyche`.
+- Validation/serialization centers on AJV, `@fastify/ajv-compiler`, and `fast-json-stringify`.
\ No newline at end of file
